【English / 英文 / 英語】

1. Scope

This license applies to all files within this repository (hereinafter "the Package").

2. Distribution Rules

  (a) All files within the following directories are distributed under the
      ARR (All Rights Reserved) license:
      - config/
      - defaultconfigs/
      - template/

  (b) All lang files (language files) under the kubejs/assets/ directory are
      distributed under the ARR license.

  (c) All files within the oritong/ directory (kubejs/assets/oritong/) are
      distributed under the ARR license.

  (d) All other files that are NOT within the oritong/ directory and are NOT
      lang files are distributed under the GNU General Public License v3
      (GPL v3).

  (e) Script files (hereinafter "JS files", including .js and other JavaScript-
      related extensions) are distributed under GPL v3 by default.

  (f) Exception: If a JS file contains inline comments explicitly stating the
      source of the code and the applicable license, that JS file shall be
      distributed under the license specified in the comments, and the
      default rule above shall not apply.

3. Precedence

  When a file matches multiple rules, its applicable license is determined
  according to the following precedence (highest to lowest):
  (1) License specified in JS file inline comments
  (2) File is within the oritong/ directory → ARR
  (3) File is within config/, defaultconfigs/, or template/ directories → ARR
  (4) File is a lang file under kubejs/assets/ → ARR
   (5) None of the above applies → GPL v3

4. Related Links

  ARR (All Rights Reserved):
    Default copyright — no public license text available.
    https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/All_rights_reserved

  GPL v3 (GNU General Public License v3):
    https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.html

